# One-off timetable migration snapshots. These are the "before" copies kept
# while a data repair is being validated; they are never a build input, and
# committing a second 235 KB near-duplicate of the timetable invites someone to
# read it as authoritative.
src/data/*.pre-migration.json
src/data/*.pre-terminal-repair.json
src/data/*.pre-season.json

